      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Honey has been used as a medicine throughout the ages and in more recent times has been \"rediscovered\" by the medical profession for treatment of burns, infected wounds, and skin ulcers. The large volume of literature reporting its effectiveness indicates that honey has potential for the treatment of periodontal disease, mouth ulcers, and other problems of oral health."},
